flowchart TD
  accTitle: Improve through a controlled comparison
  accDescr: Preserve a baseline, classify the failure, change the relevant part, compare the same scenario, and keep only demonstrated improvements.
  A["Save the baseline and failing scenario"] --> B{"What failed?"}
  B -->|Wrong intended behavior| C["Clarify one rule"]
  B -->|Implementation bug| D["Repair the causal code"]
  B -->|Dull or unclear experience| E["Test one design change"]
  B -->|Repeated workflow mistake| F["Fix context, routing, or tooling"]
  C --> G["Compare the same scenario"]
  D --> G
  E --> G
  F --> G
  G --> H{"Better without unacceptable regressions?"}
  H -->|Yes| I["Keep the change and record evidence"]
  H -->|No| J["Revise or restore the experiment"]
  J --> A
